WEBVTT

00:04.930 --> 00:09.440
And I think, little by little,
I’m getting closer to Ayako-san.

00:09.990 --> 00:14.240
The days I spend with her are always memorable,

00:14.240 --> 00:18.310
like I’m living inside a story.

00:36.140 --> 00:41.260
Today I shout out another good morning courageously

00:41.260 --> 00:46.560
The sparkling chime of hope is resounding

00:47.050 --> 00:52.140
The gentle sun is always

00:52.140 --> 00:57.660
Blessing the late coming sensation of the two of them

00:57.950 --> 01:02.880
To fall in love with a goddess is the best!

01:03.090 --> 01:12.950
Even if she is a beatrice I can't control this throbbing feeling

01:12.950 --> 01:13.800
L·O·V·E

01:13.800 --> 01:15.550
I love you MA·MO·RU!

01:15.550 --> 01:17.090
These overflowing feelings

01:17.090 --> 01:19.790
Take them high into the sky

01:19.790 --> 01:24.680
Please grant me my dazzling and sparkling dream

01:24.680 --> 01:26.480
That's right MA·MO·RU!

01:26.480 --> 01:28.010
Only for you

01:28.010 --> 01:30.680
I will show you my power of miracles

01:30.680 --> 01:32.950
I will surely, surely swear

01:32.950 --> 01:38.900
I will not end my Shining Love

01:54.780 --> 01:57.590
Once upon a time, there was a princess,

01:58.140 --> 02:03.050
cursed to eternal sleep by a witch.

02:04.690 --> 02:10.150
The only way to awaken her was for her true love to...

02:24.580 --> 02:29.580
My Prince

02:32.090 --> 02:35.000
Three Weeks
Till School Fair

02:35.000 --> 02:36.170
3 Weeks Left

02:35.420 --> 02:36.670
Welcome

02:35.420 --> 02:35.460
Welcome

02:41.840 --> 02:44.110
It’s almost time for the school fair.

02:46.210 --> 02:49.210
I have to help my class prepare for it after this.

02:49.830 --> 02:52.520
A school fair with Ayako-san, huh?

02:52.520 --> 02:54.850
I can’t wait, huh, Ayako-san?

02:56.650 --> 02:58.900
I can’t wait, huh?

03:01.560 --> 03:04.090
Then we’ll divide up the word.

03:01.580 --> 03:06.540
School Fair:
Decided

03:01.580 --> 03:06.540
Flower Gyuudon
Shop

03:01.580 --> 03:06.540
15 Votes

03:01.580 --> 03:06.540
Haunted
House

03:01.580 --> 03:06.540
6 Votes

03:04.960 --> 03:06.540
But...

03:06.540 --> 03:10.370
Why flowers and gyuudon?

03:10.370 --> 03:11.340
No idea.

03:11.340 --> 03:13.250
Honestly, I have no idea.

03:13.250 --> 03:16.100
We were almost settled on a regular gyuudon shop...

03:16.100 --> 03:19.080
Then how about we add flowers?

03:20.150 --> 03:22.140
Will Yoshimura Mamoru-san please report

03:22.140 --> 03:24.300
to the student council room immediately?

03:27.420 --> 03:28.930
Is something wrong?

03:28.930 --> 03:31.700
There’s something we’d like to ask you to do.

03:31.700 --> 03:34.690
Yeah. I guess there’s no other choice.

03:34.690 --> 03:39.690
I contacted Asuka’s house,
but it looks like that’s a no-go.

03:39.690 --> 03:41.440
And so,

03:41.440 --> 03:42.670
Mamoru-kun,

03:42.670 --> 03:44.600
we want you to help the drama club.

03:44.600 --> 03:48.740
I have no idea what you’re talking about.

03:50.040 --> 03:54.040
Every year at school fair,
the drama club puts on a play.

03:54.950 --> 03:59.970
This year, we were preparing
to perform <i>Sleeping Beauty</i>.

03:59.970 --> 04:02.220
You two are in the drama club?

04:03.290 --> 04:07.010
Akane Asuka, the captain,

04:07.010 --> 04:08.790
got sick.

04:10.890 --> 04:14.560
The drama club’s play is a tradition.

04:14.560 --> 04:16.730
We can’t cancel it.

04:17.830 --> 04:24.140
So we’d like Ayako to play the role in her place.

04:24.140 --> 04:27.410
Thus, we’d like you to take the starring role.

04:28.510 --> 04:30.440
Ayako-san and me?

04:30.440 --> 04:33.120
But I... I can’t act.

04:33.120 --> 04:34.670
We’ll help you.

04:34.670 --> 04:37.630
We’ll rewrite the script so you can do it.

04:37.630 --> 04:40.660
Then why didn’t you call Ayako-san?

04:40.660 --> 04:42.220
It’s important, isn’t it?

04:42.730 --> 04:45.010
Ayako hates things like this.

04:45.010 --> 04:47.670
Last year, she didn’t participate in the School Fair.

04:47.670 --> 04:49.560
Really?

04:51.020 --> 04:55.230
But if you agree, I think she will, too.

04:55.230 --> 04:59.010
Would you try to persuade her?

04:59.010 --> 05:00.530
But...

05:00.530 --> 05:01.980
Please!

05:01.980 --> 05:03.580
Yoshimura-san, please!

05:03.580 --> 05:06.430
This is my last play before I graduate!

05:06.430 --> 05:07.520
So, um...

05:07.520 --> 05:11.960
Ayako is the only one with the beauty and grace

05:11.960 --> 05:13.550
to replace Asuka!

05:13.550 --> 05:15.960
Yoshimura, please!

05:15.960 --> 05:17.780
Please!

05:18.770 --> 05:21.200
<i>If I can help...</i>

05:21.200 --> 05:24.380
But I can’t guarantee that she’ll agree.

05:26.300 --> 05:28.410
Warning! Warning!

05:28.410 --> 05:30.230
Intruder detected!

05:30.230 --> 05:31.480
Ayako-san...

05:31.480 --> 05:33.210
Intruder detected in the student council room.

05:33.900 --> 05:35.230
Intruder detected!

05:35.820 --> 05:37.180
Barrier one breached!

05:37.180 --> 05:39.150
This is the second student council room,

05:39.150 --> 05:42.320
far more heavily armored than the last!

05:42.320 --> 05:45.410
Even Ayako won’t be able to break these walls.

05:50.770 --> 05:52.100
<i>Goal!</i>

05:52.520 --> 05:54.470
What’s going on with me now?

05:54.470 --> 05:57.460
When did you get here? How?

05:57.780 --> 05:59.230
That’s odd...

05:59.230 --> 06:00.650
I could’ve sworn I asked you to sweep up

06:00.650 --> 06:01.960
the leaves in front of the school gate.

06:01.960 --> 06:05.270
Whenever you ask for a favor,
it means something’s up.

06:05.270 --> 06:07.120
So I finished early.

06:07.120 --> 06:10.020
So, what were you talking about?

06:10.880 --> 06:12.570
Mamoru will explain.

06:12.570 --> 06:13.910
Right, Mamoru?

06:13.910 --> 06:15.970
Yes, that’s right.

06:15.970 --> 06:18.690
Everyone, that’s not fair.

06:18.690 --> 06:19.760
What is it, Mamoru?

06:19.760 --> 06:21.090
What’s going on?

06:21.090 --> 06:23.360
Please...

06:23.360 --> 06:25.470
Um...

06:26.320 --> 06:27.530
You see.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.820
Time passes...

06:30.820 --> 06:33.780
Why did you agree?

06:33.780 --> 06:35.210
I’m sorry!

06:35.210 --> 06:38.960
You’re just giving them a reason to laugh at us!

06:38.960 --> 06:42.250
Mamoru, when did you become their servant?

06:42.250 --> 06:44.740
That’s not fair at all.

06:44.740 --> 06:47.310
Mamoru-kun’s a nice kid.

06:47.310 --> 06:48.170
<i>Right?</i>

06:48.890 --> 06:50.220
President...

06:50.220 --> 06:51.990
Oh, why not do it?

06:51.990 --> 06:55.240
You don’t have any plans that day.

06:55.240 --> 06:56.520
Or perhaps...

06:57.420 --> 07:00.560
Were you thinking of having fun with him that day?

07:01.410 --> 07:03.300
I wasn’t...

07:03.300 --> 07:05.120
Calm down, Ayako.

07:05.120 --> 07:07.720
In the last scene, the play’s star, the prince,

07:07.720 --> 07:10.240
marries the heroine, the princess.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.860
And?

07:11.860 --> 07:15.980
You can practice for the future.

07:17.170 --> 07:19.430
What are you talking about?

07:19.430 --> 07:21.140
Oh, that’s wonderful.

07:21.140 --> 07:23.630
Then we need to get ready.

07:23.630 --> 07:27.380
Yes. I’ll get a real wedding dress ready.

07:27.380 --> 07:30.400
We must record their love.

07:30.400 --> 07:32.050
Let’s have Mitsuki handle the camera.

07:32.050 --> 07:32.260
Shelter BOX

07:32.390 --> 07:33.260
And...

07:33.630 --> 07:34.760
Ayako-san?

07:49.260 --> 07:50.250
Ayako-san.

07:50.250 --> 07:51.500
Ayako-san!

07:52.980 --> 07:56.040
This would’ve been a good photo,
but I arrived too late.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.540
Mitsuki-san...

07:57.540 --> 08:01.000
Right. Youko-san, why’d you make her mad?

08:01.000 --> 08:03.310
I don’t think she’s mad.

08:03.310 --> 08:04.210
Indeed.

08:04.210 --> 08:05.630
I think this’ll work.

08:05.630 --> 08:06.930
You really think so?

08:06.930 --> 08:08.200
OK, smile.

08:08.730 --> 08:10.740
No! It’s gonna collapse!

08:10.740 --> 08:12.000
Yagi, just a bit more!

08:12.000 --> 08:16.720
Maybe Ayako-san doesn’t know
the <i>Sleeping Beauty </i>story.

08:16.720 --> 08:18.060
Actually, she’s into it.

08:18.060 --> 08:22.140
If she knows what happens in the story, then maybe...

08:43.780 --> 08:46.710
Mamoru, why are you here?

08:46.710 --> 08:49.890
At first, I didn’t want to do it, either.

08:49.890 --> 08:52.610
It’s embarrassing, and it looks hard.

08:52.610 --> 08:54.320
But I dunno...

08:54.320 --> 08:56.840
It’s not just because the drama club

08:57.250 --> 09:00.050
really needs our help or anything like that...

09:00.050 --> 09:04.550
I just thought I’d like to do something with you

09:04.550 --> 09:06.340
at the School Fair.

09:06.340 --> 09:10.580
So would you do it with me, Ayako-san?

09:23.400 --> 09:28.780
If you insist, I guess I could.

09:28.780 --> 09:30.250
Really?

09:32.000 --> 09:34.540
Was that a sneeze?

09:34.540 --> 09:36.090
Don’t worry about it.

09:36.700 --> 09:38.560
It’s a cute sneeze.

09:38.560 --> 09:40.790
No, wait... Are you OK?

09:40.790 --> 09:42.380
I’m fine.

09:42.380 --> 09:44.350
I just caught a little cold.

09:44.350 --> 09:46.190
Anyway, let’s do our best.

09:46.190 --> 09:47.470
Right!

09:49.580 --> 09:53.860
Um, whoever might you be?

09:54.260 --> 09:55.900
Alone in the forest like this...

09:57.070 --> 09:58.830
Maybe this was a bad idea.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.550
Mamoru.

10:05.150 --> 10:06.420
Take a deep breath.

10:07.380 --> 10:08.420
OK.

10:12.540 --> 10:14.500
It’s OK. Calm down.

10:14.500 --> 10:16.300
You can do it.

10:17.680 --> 10:18.930
OK!

10:35.860 --> 10:37.220
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

10:37.220 --> 10:40.230
Your school’s having its festival soon, right?

10:40.230 --> 10:41.530
Yeah, it is.

10:41.530 --> 10:45.220
I was talking about going with Mom. Is that OK?

10:45.220 --> 10:47.710
Of course, I’m going no matter what,
but I thought I’d ask.

10:47.710 --> 10:49.450
What are you going to do?

10:50.100 --> 10:53.160
Some kind of gyuudon restaurant...

10:53.160 --> 10:55.640
I’ll bring the pamphlet when it’s done.

10:55.640 --> 10:57.050
OK!

11:00.920 --> 11:05.130
<i>It’s hard to tell her I’m in a play with Ayako-san.</i>

11:05.130 --> 11:06.310
<i>But...</i>

11:07.090 --> 11:08.980
I have to do my best!

11:11.600 --> 11:14.520
One Week
Till School Fair

11:18.360 --> 11:20.030
Out of the way!

11:20.850 --> 11:22.810
Um, I’m with the Student Council.

11:22.810 --> 11:24.370
The School Fair guidebook is ready...

11:25.760 --> 11:27.050
No!

11:27.050 --> 11:29.290
This isn’t how my gyuudon should be!

11:29.290 --> 11:31.920
You jerks didn’t pre-cook the meat, did you?

11:31.920 --> 11:35.840
If you don’t, it tastes all bloody!

11:36.440 --> 11:37.770
You there!

11:37.770 --> 11:39.490
It’s white wine, not red wine!

11:39.490 --> 11:40.470
Don’t screw it up!

11:40.470 --> 11:42.740
White wine is my gyuudon’s secret ingredient!

11:42.740 --> 11:44.550
I’m sorry! I’m sorry!

11:45.480 --> 11:48.310
Don’t try to do it your way, newbie.

11:48.310 --> 11:49.140
This is good.

11:56.650 --> 11:57.970
I’m with the Student Council.

11:57.970 --> 11:59.150
The guidebook is...

12:00.180 --> 12:01.490
It’s the Witch Beatrice!

12:01.490 --> 12:04.280
Takasu Ayako is carrying the School Fair guidebook!

12:04.280 --> 12:06.160
Is this some dark portent?

12:06.160 --> 12:07.530
When the Witch Beatrice appears,

12:07.530 --> 12:09.580
the seas will split, and the sun
will be engulfed by darkness!

12:09.580 --> 12:11.690
The apocalypse is upon us!

12:11.690 --> 12:13.600
Bless us, oh Lord, for we have sinned...

12:13.600 --> 12:14.990
We’re all doomed!

12:17.920 --> 12:19.270
Ayako-san?

12:20.670 --> 12:23.590
Hmph, hmph, hmph, hmph...

12:26.300 --> 12:27.740
What’s wrong?

12:27.740 --> 12:28.730
Nothing.

12:28.730 --> 12:31.760
Now, now... Beatrice’s Angel of Death

12:31.760 --> 12:34.570
is actively participating in the School Fair.

12:34.570 --> 12:36.270
I think it makes sense.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.730
Shut up!

12:38.500 --> 12:40.140
I’ve never heard that before.

12:40.140 --> 12:43.080
It’s a cute sneeze.

12:43.080 --> 12:44.980
Makes me want to give you a hug.

12:44.980 --> 12:46.250
Shut up!

12:46.250 --> 12:47.810
Mamoru, let’s go!

12:48.270 --> 12:49.200
Ayako-san!

12:49.200 --> 12:51.430
Are you really all right?

12:51.430 --> 12:52.620
You said it’s a cold.

12:54.450 --> 12:57.210
I’m fine. It was just a little dusty.

12:57.990 --> 13:00.050
I see...

13:01.920 --> 13:04.550
By the way, how’s the play going?

13:04.550 --> 13:05.680
Well?

13:05.830 --> 13:09.670
Snap

13:07.160 --> 13:09.680
Well...

13:11.500 --> 13:17.480
Um... Ever since I saw you
in the forest, I, well...

13:18.050 --> 13:23.610
I, um... I’ve dreamed of you since that day.

13:27.160 --> 13:29.250
The normal scenes work fine,

13:29.250 --> 13:32.750
but they seem to get worked up
during the love scenes.

13:32.750 --> 13:34.460
It’s nice and realistic. I like it.

13:34.460 --> 13:36.890
The play won’t work like that.

13:36.890 --> 13:38.410
What do we do?

13:38.410 --> 13:40.790
It can’t be helped that they’re that way.

13:40.790 --> 13:43.710
We’ll just have to change the script
to reduce the love scenes.

13:44.300 --> 13:46.430
Then how about this?

13:46.430 --> 13:50.900
K-K-K-Kiss scene?

13:50.900 --> 13:52.500
Yes, a kiss scene.

13:52.500 --> 13:53.430
What do you mean?

13:53.430 --> 13:55.940
I thought we’d change the script a bit.

13:56.640 --> 14:00.350
We decided to add a kiss between
the prince and the princess.

14:00.350 --> 14:02.760
N-N-No one told me about that!

14:02.760 --> 14:03.890
That’s right!

14:03.890 --> 14:07.300
In the original story, the princess
awakens to the prince’s kiss.

14:07.300 --> 14:09.020
You must have that, you know.

14:09.020 --> 14:11.250
But...

14:11.250 --> 14:13.580
I’m not doing it! No!

14:13.580 --> 14:15.490
Kissing Mamoru?

14:15.490 --> 14:16.670
That isn’t it!

14:16.670 --> 14:20.070
Maybe we should have moved
the scene to a sunset beach.

14:22.580 --> 14:28.750
<i>My first kiss is going to be romantic,
by the sea at sunset...</i>

14:28.750 --> 14:32.510
I posted a wonderful movie for download on the Student Council website.

14:35.620 --> 14:37.550
Let’s get started, Youko.

14:38.260 --> 14:39.640
Mamoru, come with me.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.430
What?

14:45.990 --> 14:48.220
We changed the story a little.

14:48.220 --> 14:49.380
Behold.

14:49.380 --> 14:52.530
Rather than just the princess,

14:53.440 --> 14:55.440
we added a fiancée the prince’s father,
the king, presses upon him!

14:55.440 --> 14:56.440
A fiancée!

14:56.440 --> 14:58.570
A village girl who meets the prince
in the forest and falls in love!

14:58.570 --> 14:59.540
A village girl!

14:59.540 --> 15:01.920
A cabinet minister’s daughter who seeks power!

15:02.920 --> 15:04.750
A younger sister, unrelated by blood!

15:05.800 --> 15:09.760
A beautiful teacher who falls in love with him,
despite being his tutor!

15:09.760 --> 15:10.260
Me?

15:10.600 --> 15:14.500
And then, and then... A princess from
a nearby country who stalks him!

15:14.500 --> 15:15.560
Namaste.

15:15.560 --> 15:17.310
And then, the story itself...

15:17.310 --> 15:20.570
A tale of love and hate, that spin out of control,

15:17.310 --> 15:23.900
Images From Work-In-Progress.

15:20.570 --> 15:22.410
and lurking jealousy...

15:22.410 --> 15:23.900
As they all fight for their beloved prince!

15:23.900 --> 15:27.240
But the prince overcomes these trials and heads

15:27.240 --> 15:29.900
for the castle, where his beloved princess awaits!

15:33.700 --> 15:37.020
But there, he finds the minister’s daughter!

15:39.380 --> 15:41.190
She and the minister have plotted

15:41.190 --> 15:44.080
to move the princess to another castle!

15:44.080 --> 15:48.320
But knowing none of this, he kisses her!

15:50.480 --> 15:52.070
He kisses her!

15:52.680 --> 15:55.080
He kisses her!

15:55.080 --> 15:57.490
Hurry up, Mamoru-san!

16:00.560 --> 16:01.940
Fine, then.

16:07.920 --> 16:09.880
Shione-san, I don’t think...

16:12.320 --> 16:13.820
No!

16:19.520 --> 16:22.640
He hasn’t... He hasn’t kissed me yet!

16:22.640 --> 16:23.900
Ayako-san!

16:31.970 --> 16:33.680
Idiot!

16:33.680 --> 16:35.050
Ayako-san!

16:53.510 --> 16:54.910
Ayako-san...

17:03.100 --> 17:07.810
Um... I’m really sorry.

17:09.850 --> 17:11.460
For what?

17:12.440 --> 17:16.370
Um, well, you know...

17:16.370 --> 17:18.470
Anyway, let’s go inside.

17:19.210 --> 17:20.500
It’s OK.

17:20.500 --> 17:22.680
They’re all gone.

17:22.680 --> 17:24.230
Come on.

17:27.440 --> 17:30.020
I’ll be out in the hallway.

17:30.030 --> 17:32.960
I’d be kinda sad alone.

17:32.960 --> 17:34.370
Stay there.

17:42.180 --> 17:43.400
Mamoru...

17:43.400 --> 17:44.250
Yes?

17:44.250 --> 17:46.830
Do you want to kiss me?

17:48.550 --> 17:50.230
I-I’m sorry!

17:52.380 --> 17:55.710
I-I’m not happy about the play,

17:55.710 --> 17:58.630
but the President’s script is interesting.

17:58.630 --> 18:00.760
I thought so, as well.

18:00.760 --> 18:03.190
It was funny, and there were also some exciting parts.

18:03.770 --> 18:05.780
I have my pride, too.

18:08.940 --> 18:11.690
I’ve taken it up. I can’t drop it now.

18:12.330 --> 18:13.440
Yeah.

18:13.440 --> 18:15.780
Of course, we can just pretend.

18:15.780 --> 18:22.440
I, um... Well, a real kiss would...

18:23.580 --> 18:27.320
So when it first looked like I
was going to kiss Shione-san...

18:27.320 --> 18:29.650
In the play, I mean...

18:29.650 --> 18:33.620
But I couldn’t turn it down... I’m sorry.

18:33.620 --> 18:37.180
Thank you for inviting me to do the play with you.

18:37.760 --> 18:44.170
No one’s ever invited me to do
something with them like this.

18:44.170 --> 18:48.190
When I was a kid, I always watched
everyone else having fun.

18:48.710 --> 18:55.230
But I couldn’t join them, so... I don’t know.

18:55.860 --> 18:57.070
Ayako-san...

18:57.820 --> 19:00.450
Thank you, Mamoru.

19:02.490 --> 19:07.020
It’s not that she doesn’t like festivals and stuff, it’s that she never...

19:07.020 --> 19:10.580
We don’t get many chances to do these school fairs.

19:10.580 --> 19:13.030
We need to make sure we don’t regret anything.

19:13.970 --> 19:15.630
You can turn around now.

19:22.610 --> 19:25.600
Ayako-san, you want to go around

19:25.600 --> 19:27.780
and look at things on the day of the festival?

19:28.830 --> 19:33.140
We may not be able to see everything
because of the play, but...

19:33.650 --> 19:35.120
Yeah, that sounds good.

19:35.500 --> 19:40.550
I doubt I’ve ever looked forward to a festival this much.

19:41.250 --> 19:43.120
Same with me.

19:43.120 --> 19:45.840
Because you’re here.

19:53.840 --> 19:56.290
Oh, Princess, at least we meet.

19:56.290 --> 20:00.010
My prince, I’ve always loved you...

20:04.430 --> 20:04.470
Five Days Left!!

20:05.820 --> 20:07.250
Five days left.

20:14.400 --> 20:14.440
Four Days Left!!

20:15.380 --> 20:16.650
Four days left.

20:16.650 --> 20:18.140
Ayako-san!

20:17.560 --> 20:20.860
Takasu Ayako Research Club
Stand Against the Student Council’s Dictatorship!

20:18.140 --> 20:20.860
Ayako-san, I’ll make sure you’re nice and clean...

20:22.240 --> 20:24.200
Three Days Left!

20:22.400 --> 20:24.200
Three days left.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.230
OK!

20:24.700 --> 20:25.900
A little more to the right.

20:36.090 --> 20:38.160
Hehe, I burned up.

20:39.000 --> 20:41.510
Two Days Left!!

20:39.000 --> 20:41.510
Two days left.

20:41.510 --> 20:44.420
School Festival
Tomorrow

20:44.420 --> 20:45.870
This way!

21:00.400 --> 21:02.020
Are you OK?

21:02.020 --> 21:03.990
You look pale.

21:03.990 --> 21:05.280
I’m fine.

21:06.660 --> 21:08.140
Where’s the princess?

21:08.140 --> 21:09.490
The princess?

21:09.490 --> 21:10.540
Over here.

21:10.540 --> 21:13.500
You should go to the nurse...

21:13.500 --> 21:15.290
Ayako-san!

21:15.290 --> 21:17.210
What? I can’t hear you.

21:17.660 --> 21:19.360
Ayako-san, you should go to the nurse’s...

21:33.390 --> 21:34.490
Ayako-san!

22:01.290 --> 22:06.970
My heart is racing and I'm going to give you

22:06.970 --> 22:12.170
This sparkling emotion

22:12.560 --> 22:18.300
The evening color is dyed into this orange shirt

22:18.360 --> 22:23.450
I catch it from behind you and my heart throbbing

22:23.560 --> 22:30.410
It's an everyday thrill just to be with you

22:30.410 --> 22:37.840
I can't say it well enough but thank you

22:37.840 --> 22:43.040
Venus Dream the hidden power

22:43.040 --> 22:49.240
This feeling will change into that power

22:49.240 --> 22:54.360
Power Dream I found what I want to protect

22:54.360 --> 23:00.770
That is your smile and your feelings

23:19.470 --> 23:23.950
Who ate the salt daifuku I put here?

23:23.950 --> 23:29.290
You can’t just take people’s things... That’s an awful way to die.

23:29.290 --> 23:31.120
You there.

23:31.120 --> 23:35.390
If you see the person who took it, contact me right away.

23:35.390 --> 23:38.370
I’m glad we could work together on this.

23:39.200 --> 23:41.900
Next time: Hearts Together.

23:39.200 --> 23:43.940
Hearts Together
